source: Synthesized for 2.2.8 (question-format work) from the harness's own layout as the earlier fixtures in this library show it, or from its program's strings where no capture exists: a long question with paragraphs, a fenced shell block and a fenced Python block, and options with descriptions. Neutral demo text only. Codex's layout follows its rust-v0.169.0 request_user_input snapshots.
